Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《黑客帝国3：矩阵革命》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也找不到 舰长 找不到奈奥比和高斯的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing, sir. No sign of Niobe or Ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只看到一些蓝色药丸状的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing but blue pills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.51,0:01:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们应该进入母体找他们吗? - 不用了 很可能他们已经完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should we try to contact them? - Won't matter. My gut says they're down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:32.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我们应该回去! - 不行 如果那艘 战舰仍能飞行 我们还需要用到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should start back. - lf that ship can fly, we need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:33.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就怕你会这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was afraid you'd say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细查看每一个管道、窟窿和裂口...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search every pipe, every hole, every crack we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.81,0:01:38.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大范围搜索 速度要快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweep as wide as possible, as fast as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:43.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 舰长 这些线路上布满了乌贼 - 最好能尽快找到他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lines are crawling with calamari. - The sooner we find them the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:52.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吃点东西吧 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thought you could use something to eat. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:55.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么变化吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:58.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:03.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他的情况怎么样? - 他很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is he? - He's gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少在他醒来之前 他都会很好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least until he wakes up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:10.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么意思? - 舰长要找他问话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - Captain has some questions for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:12.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望他早已知道怎样交待吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd better have some good answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:16.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留意过这些伤痕吗? 我想是他自己弄伤的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see these cuts? I think they're self- inflicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:20.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为何会这样? - 可能他疯了吧 我也不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - VDTs maybe. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:25.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 正如我刚才所说... 他最好能给舰长满意的答复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But like I said, the answer better be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦 麻烦你再在整个母体内搜索一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roland, I'd like to run another search through the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 搜索什么? - 搜索尼欧的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what? - For Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:35.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他有可能在母体内吗? 他并没有连进母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could he be in the Matrix, sir? He's not plugged in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:38.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就当是满足我的需要吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:52.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一点一直令我迷惑不解 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what keeps bothering me. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:56.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的脑电波并不象是昏迷的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His neural patterns don't read like someone who's in a coma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:59.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的脑电波状况一直都这样 真是奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strange thing is, I see these patterns all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:03.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 在哪见过吗? - 进入母体的人就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - On someone jacked in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:18.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也没找到 他不在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The big bupkes. Nada. He's not in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:20.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 舰长 有预测结果了 - 还要用多少时间?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, I got the projections. - How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:25.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根据切入点和刚才的速度 乌贼军团大概会在二十个小时内到达锡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Based on point of entry and the past speed, the machines will be in Zion in 20 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:28.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去得太快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus H. Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:33.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们得布署行动 AK 到上层去 监控全像探测仪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's move with a purpose. AK, I want you on holographics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:36.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摩斯 预备好战舰前后的枪炮 随时装备开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mauser, I want forward and aft guns manned at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:40.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 战舰要以最低能耗的方式前进 - 好的 我照办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And make sure we are running on as few pads as possible. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:43.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿! 嘿! 有电话 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! You got a call. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:47.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是接线员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:50.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是守护天使打来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Seraph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:54.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知要我告诉你们 你们必须马上过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bring word from the Oracle. You must come at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.61,0:04:08.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:13.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? - 我叫莎蒂 而你叫尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - My name is Sati. Your name is Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:16.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸说没想到会在这里碰到你 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My papa says you're not supposed to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:21.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说你一定是迷路了 你是不是迷路了 尼欧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says you must be lost. Are you lost, Neo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:28.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我现在在什么地方? - 这里是火车站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where am l? - This is the train station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:32.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是母体么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the Matrix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:38.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火车要去的地方才是母体 我们一家人正要去母体 可是你不能跟我们一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where the train goes. That's where we're going, but you cannot go with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:42.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么不能? - 他不会让你去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? - He won't let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁不让我去? - 那个列车员 我不喜欢他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who won't? - The Trainman. I don't like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:50.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...可是我爸爸说我们必须听命于他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my papa says we have to do what the Trainman says...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:54.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则他会将我们永远遗弃在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or else he will leave us here forever and ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:13.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思、崔妮蒂 谢谢你们前来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus, Trinity, thank you for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活了这么久 我领悟到一个道理...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing I've learned in all my years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.59,0:05:19.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我们总是无法随心所欲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is that nothing ever works out the way you want it to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:23.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? - 我是先知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - I'm the Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来一言难尽 令人伤感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish there was an easy way to get through this, but there ain't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情无可避免 我也很无奈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry this had to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:36.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 我得附体在别人的身上 来跟你们会面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I couldn't be sitting here like you remember me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.01,0:05:39.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没想到会弄成这个地步 - 发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...but it wasn't meant to be. - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我作出了选择 而为了这个选择...我必须付出沉重代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made a choice, and that choice cost me more than I wanted it to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么选择?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:49.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,选择帮助你们 指引尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To help you, to guide Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:55.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果想知道所作的选择是否明智...就看你是否会仍然选择那样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, since the real test for any choice is having to make the same choice again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:59.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在清楚知道将会付出什么代价的情况下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...knowing full well what it might cost...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:03.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对所作出的选择充满信心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I guess I feel pretty good about that choice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:06.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我现在仍然选择这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because here I am, at it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:10.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道尼欧的情况吗? - 知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know what happened to Neo? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:15.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他被困在真实世界和 母体世界之间的分界处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is trapped in a place between this world and the machine world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:19.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个交界处 由一个叫"列车员"的程序监管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The link is controlled by a program called the Trainman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:24.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他常常偷运程序进出母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He uses it to smuggle programs in and out of the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.39,0:06:27.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他比你们早发现尼欧的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he finds out where Neo is before you get to him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:31.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要达成目的 就不容易了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then I'm afraid our choices are going to become difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:34.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么? - 因为列车员为之工作的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Because of who the Trainman works for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:36.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梅罗纹奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Merovingian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:41.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他悬赏追杀你们 你们要随时保持警惕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has placed a bounty on your lives. You must be careful at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,守护天使知道怎样找到那个列车员 他会陪同你们一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seraph knows how to find the Trainman. He'll go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:49.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些年来 都是他保护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years he has protected me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:52.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望他也能保护你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope he can do the same for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:56.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请跟我来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:03.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oracle....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思 我知道你在想什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:09.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你心中布满疑团 顾虑重重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you're filled with doubt, clouded by uncertainty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:14.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了这么多事情... 你叫我怎样相信你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After everything that has happened, how can you expect me to believe you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:16.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有指望要你相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:18.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想达成我做出的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect just what I've always expected:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:23.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相不相信我 由你自己决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you to make up your own damn mind. Believe me or don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:29.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我所能做的就是告诉你 你的朋友身陷险境...他需要你们的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I can do is tell you that your friend is in trouble, and he needs your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:32.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他需要我们的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs all our help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:37.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是母体里的人吗? - 是的...不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you from the Matrix? - Yes. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:41.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 只是曾经进入过母体而已 - 那你为什么离开母体呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean, I was. - Why did you leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:45.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不得不离开 - 我也是不得不离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I had to. - I had to leave my home too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:49.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莎蒂 过来 不要打扰那个可怜的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sati! Come here, darling. Leave the poor man in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:52.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Papa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:59.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉 她总是很好奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry. She is still very curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我认识你 - 对 我们在法国人的餐馆碰过面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know you. - Yes, in the restaurant of the Frenchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:08.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫拉玛·肯德拉 这是我的妻子卡玛拉 女儿莎蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Rama-Kandra. This is my wife, Kamala. My daughter, Sati.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你非常荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are most honored to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:13.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们是被编写出来的程序 - 是啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are programs. - Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:18.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是发电厂系统管理员程序 负责将资源再生利用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the power- plant systems manager for recycling operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:22.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的妻子是互动软件程序员程序 她构思过很多精彩的创意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife is an interactive software programmer. She is highly creative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里干什么? 你并不是这里的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here? You do not belong here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:30.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡拉玛! 唉呀 真不好意思 我妻子的说话方式比较直率{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kamala! Goodness, I apologize. My wife can be very direct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:32.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:34.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不知道我为何在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:38.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我甚至连这里是什么地方也不知道 - 这里哪也不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't even know where "here" is. - This place is nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:41.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是你的世界和我们世界的分界处而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is between your world and our world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:46.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个列车员是谁? - 他是法国人的手下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's the Trainman? - He works for the Frenchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好象我早知道你会这样说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did I know you would say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:51.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个法国人很记仇 而且有仇必报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Frenchman does not forget, and he does not forgive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:55.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你清楚他的为人? - 我只知道该知道的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know him? - I know only what I need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:59.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想拿些我们这个世界 独有的东西到你的世界...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that if you want to take something from our world into your world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:02.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就得靠那个法国人帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that does not belong there, you must go to the Frenchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:05.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你来这里就是 找那个法国人帮忙吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you're doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:08.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉玛 别再说了! - 我不想对人家冷酷无情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rama, please. - I do not want to be cruel, Kamala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:12.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能以后再也见不到其他人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may never see another face for the rest of his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:13.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:17.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 刚才的问题 你不用回答了 - 不要紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't have to answer that question. - No, I don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:20.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答案很简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:28.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我深爱我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love my daughter very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:31.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我心中她是最美丽的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find her to be the most beautiful thing I have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:34.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是在我们属于的那个世界中 我无法让她免受伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where we are from, that is not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:37.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为每个被编写出来的程序都要有其用途{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every program that is created must have a purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有用途 那么就会被删除{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it does not, it is deleted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:45.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我找那个法国人 是为了救我女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to the Frenchman to save my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:49.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你仍不明白吗? - 我只是从未...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You do not understand. - I just have never...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:52.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...从未听说过程序也会有爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard a program speak of love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:57.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爱是人类才有的感情 - 不 爱只是一个字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt is a human emotion. - No, it is a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:03.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,字面下所体现的亲密关系才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What matters is the connection the word implies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:07.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到 你正深爱着某个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see that you are in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:12.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了爱情天长地久 你愿意牺牲些什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me what you would give to hold on to that connection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:19.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那可能你来这里的原因跟我一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then perhaps the reason you are here is not so different than the reason I am here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:28.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:33.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 滚开! 不要靠近我! - 我们不是来找麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get away! Get away from me! - We don't want trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:36.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 滚得远远的 - 我们需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get the hell away from me! - We need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:39.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮不了你 谁也帮不了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help you! No one can help you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:32.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:45.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:53.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 火车什么时候到? - 已经晚点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When is the train due? - lt is already late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:55.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过列车员是不会迟到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like the Trainman to be late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:12:00.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 火车迟到跟我有关吗? - 我说不定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think it has something to do with me? - I cannot say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:03.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事谁也不清楚 只有先知才知道吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows such things? Only the Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你认识先知? - 所有人都认识先知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know the Oracle? - Everyone knows the Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:08.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在遇到那个法国人之前我曾经请教过她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I consulted with her before I met with the Frenchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:11.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她答应在我们父女分开后 替我照顾女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She promised to watch Sati after we said goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.61,0:12:13.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,分开?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不跟她一起吗? - 那是不可能的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not staying with her? - lt is not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:21.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟那个法国人的协议 只安排了我女儿一人而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our arrangement with the Frenchman was for our daughter only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:24.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我跟我妻子必须回去 - 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My wife and I must return to our world. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:27.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是我们的宿命 - 你相信宿命?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is our karma. - You believe in karma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:30.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宿命跟爱一样 只是一个字眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karma is a word, like love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:35.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一种表达出"我来这世上有何任务"的方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A way of saying: "What I am here to do."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:38.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不埋怨宿命 我安于宿命 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not resent my karma. I'm grateful for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:42.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢它让我能拥有 贤慧的妻子 漂亮的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grateful for my wonderful wife, for my beautiful daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:47.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们是宿命对我的恩赐 作为回报 我必须做好宿命交给我的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are gifts, and so I do what I must do to honor them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:53.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爸爸 火车来了! - 是啊! 拿好行李! 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Papa, the train! - Yes. Find your bag. Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:57.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来帮你拿行李吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I carry that for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:13:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点吧! 已经迟到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry it up, I'm late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:14.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? - 他是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - He is a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:18.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉玛! - 我认得你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rama. - I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.89,0:13:23.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你就是他们要找的人 - 我需要回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So that's what they wanted. - I need to get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:25.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要什么我都可以给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pay you whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:29.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何我都要上这列火车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One way or another, I'm getting on this train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行、不行、不行、不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:34.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得留在这里 除非梅罗纹奇改口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll stay here until the Merovingian says different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:39.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我认识他 我会向他提议 那你将永远留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I know him... ...you're gonna be here for a long, long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:43.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我并不想伤害你 - 你还不知道吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want to hurt you. - You don't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:46.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是我建造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I built this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:51.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 我说什么就是什么 想怎样就怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here, I make the rules. Down here, I make the threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:59.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 我就是上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here, I'm God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:05.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不想跟他留在这里 就快上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the train or you'll stay here with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:24.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该回去找先知指点一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should return to the Oracle. She will know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:28.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 我们自己就有对策{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We know what has to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:44.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:14.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真会开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:17.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到 没有翅膀的天使来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit, it's wingless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:22.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 你一定是来找死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get it. You must be ready to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:24.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来找他谈谈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to speak with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:29.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想进去...那要看你是否打得过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only way you're getting through this door is over my big, dead ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就这么定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:57.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在俱乐部 不允许带武器进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no weapons allowed in the club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:16:00.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电梯底下有个衣帽寄存处 那里有位服务小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the bottom of this elevator, there is a coat- check girl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:03.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们幸运 那里只有一个守卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and if we are lucky, one man for checking weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:06.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们运气背呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we're unlucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就会有很多守卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be many men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:13.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为您... 噢 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I take your... Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:36.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的见鬼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:48.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:50.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是无翼天使 这个浪子回头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prodigal child returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:02.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,守护天使 你是来领赏金的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you here for the bounty, Seraph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:07.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 你们的枪里有多少颗子弹?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, how many bullets are there in those guns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:11.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我不知道 但应该不够杀光这里的人吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, but I don't think you have enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:13.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们只想谈谈 - 噢 好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We only want to talk. - Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:18.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然很想和我谈谈 你拼死闯进来也是为了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you do. You have fought through Hel to do so. Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:21.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我会把我的计划告诉你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what I will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:25.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下 我答应不伤害你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put down the guns, and I will promise you a safe passage out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要保证我们三个人都安全 - 可以、可以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All three of us? - Oh, yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:31.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:57.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[法语]真是令人惊讶!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:20:02.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久前我们才会过面...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who could have guessed we would see each other so soon after our last meeting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:06.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...谁会想到这么快又见面了? 天公造美吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Fates are too kind, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:10.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个叛徒把他们带到这里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since you, my little Judas, have brought them here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:15.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...这样看来 那个算命婆的灵魂 已经附体到其他人身上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I can only surmise that the fortuneteller has found herself another shell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:18.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有些失望 但也是在我意料之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disappointing, but not unexpected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:22.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒希望她能吸取教训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope, however, she has the good manners to learn her lesson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.31,0:20:25.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并且铭记有因必有果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and to remember that there is no action without consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:30.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果从我这里拿了东西...就得付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you take something from me, you will pay the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:33.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我们为何来这里吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why we are here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.31,0:20:40.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思 这算什么问题? 我当然知道 而且必须知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now, what kind of question is this? Of course I know. It is my business to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.09,0:20:43.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人会说这是巧合 但我并不这么认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some might think this is a strange coincidence, but I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:49.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我很想知道...尼欧进入母体的经过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am curious, though, as to how it actually happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:52.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道吗? - 不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:54.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:56.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,估计也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:59.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过最好还是先问一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is always best to ask, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:02.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想跟你做个交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want to make a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:08.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思 你总是开门见山 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always straight to business, huh, Morpheus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:12.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有你们想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I have something you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.64,0:21:14.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果要达成交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make a deal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:20.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你们就得有我想要的东西 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you must have something I want, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:24.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在碰巧我想要某些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it so happens there is something I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:29.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我来到这里 就一直梦寐以求想得到的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something I have wanted ever since I first came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:32.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据说不能靠强取豪夺来得到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is said they cannot be taken...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.38,0:21:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只能靠人家甘心施予{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they can only be given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:37.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:41.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知的双眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eyes of the Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你们我们都受制于因果循环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you before, there is no escaping the nature of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:52.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们再次见到我就是因果循环促成的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is that nature that has again brought you to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:55.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说这只是巧合 但我认为这是必然的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where some see coincidence, I see consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:59.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人会说这只是偶然 但我认为这是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where others see chance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.59,0:22:01.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你们需要付出的代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I see cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.83,0:22:07.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把先知的双眼拿来给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me the eyes of the Oracle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:11.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会归还你们的救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I will give you back your savior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:15.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来 这个交易还是挺公平合理的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems a perfectly fair and reasonable deal to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:18.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说得对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:22.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间陪你胡扯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have time for this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:56.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是想做个交易吗? 那么这个交易怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna make a deal? How about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:23:01.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把尼欧交还给我 不然的话 现在我们就同归于尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give me Neo, or we all die, right here, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:04.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个交易真有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.99,0:23:11.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的准备好为这个男人牺牲?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are really ready to die for this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.24,0:23:15.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 无庸置疑 - 她可是说真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Believe it. - She'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:18.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必要时 她会杀掉我们全部人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she has to, she'll kill every one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:21.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她非常爱他 热恋中的人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.32,0:23:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...跟疯颠的人并没有什么差别 真令人惊讶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is remarkable how similar the pattern of love is to the pattern of insanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.72,0:23:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.36,0:23:30.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梅罗 你如何决定?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it gonna be, Merv?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:38.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 之前我能闯进这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You got yourself in here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.80,0:23:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就能离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you can get yourself out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.68,0:24:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好接我们回去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:33.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快了 长官 我们正在清除一些攻击我们系统的旧程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost, sir. They got some pretty ancient hacks here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.60,0:24:35.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 找到尼欧了吗? - 你看不到他吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you found Neo? - Can't you see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.07,0:24:39.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 长官 刚才有资料出现 但不确定是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. We read something, but I couldn't tell what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:45.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不能够离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't leave yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.89,0:24:50.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须去见她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:53.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.17,0:24:56.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以后就没机会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.22,0:25:00.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 窍门就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. That's the secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.53,0:25:03.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你必须双手并用 - 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've got to use your hands. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.54,0:25:06.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,饼干跟其他东西一样 需要爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cookies need love like everything does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.74,0:25:09.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.70,0:25:14.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本想在你来访之前做好饼干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping to have these done before you got here. Oh, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.74,0:25:18.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 好了 莎蒂...该尝尝味道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sati, honey, I think it's time for a tasting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.84,0:25:22.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去给守护天使试试 看看这些饼干做得好不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the bowl to Seraph and find out if they're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.11,0:25:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.73,0:25:27.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很高兴你能够出来 - 我也很高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm glad you got out. - Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.01,0:25:33.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 你认得我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do you recognize me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.18,0:25:38.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一部分吧 - 说的是 灵魂附体后就是这样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A part of you. - Yeah, that's how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:41.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来有些东西仍在 但有些东西却没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some bits you lose, some bits you keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.64,0:25:45.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我照镜子的时候也认不得自己...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't yet recognize my face in the mirror...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.74,0:25:48.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但我仍然喜欢吃糖果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I still love candy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.84,0:25:52.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不吃了 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.51,0:25:55.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得你初次来找我时的样子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember how you were when you first walked through my door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.77,0:26:01.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那时你紧张得全身打颤 现在再看看你气定神闲的表情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jittery as a June bug. And now, just look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.09,0:26:04.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 你真的令我感到吃惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure did surprise me, Neo, and you still do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.73,0:26:07.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也有很有地方让我感到吃惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me a few surprises too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:10.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你得到过我的启迪吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope I helped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:14.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮我来到这里 但这是为了什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You helped me to get here, but my question is, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.06,0:26:16.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对抗母体的战争接下去将会怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.02,0:26:18.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 战争会怎样终结? - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where does it end? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.61,0:26:22.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不知道? 还是不想告诉我? - 我跟你说过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't know or you won't tell me? - I told you before...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.73,0:26:27.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不明白为什么选择那样做 你就无法参透背后的意义 所有的人都无法参透{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...no one can see beyond a choice they don't understand, and I mean no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.77,0:26:31.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么选择? - 那并不要紧 那只是我的选择而已 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What choice? - lt doesn't matter. It's my choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:34.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都有自己需要做出的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have mine to make, same as you have yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.00,0:26:38.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的选择是不是包括了 什么是要告诉我的 什么是要向我隐瞒的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that include what things to tell me and what not to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.33,0:26:41.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然不是 - 那你为何没有提过母体设计师?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of course not. - Why didn't you tell me about the Architect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.96,0:26:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有提过锡安以及在我之前的救世主? 为什么不把真相告诉我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About Zion and the ones before me? Why didn't you tell me the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:51.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 因为那时候时机未到 - 时机是由谁决定的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because it wasn't time for you to know. - Who decided it wasn't time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.17,0:26:54.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.06,0:26:57.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,认识自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know Thyself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.56,0:27:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原来时机决定于我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.45,0:27:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我想现在是时候去了解更多的事情了 - 我也想了解更多的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then I think it's time for me to know a few more things. - So do l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.05,0:27:13.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何我的灵魂可以脱离身驱 独自进入母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me how I separated my mind from my body without jacking in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.25,0:27:16.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何我只用念力就能击退乌贼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me how I stopped four sentinels by thinking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.52,0:27:20.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me just what the hell is happening to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.15,0:27:25.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救世主的力量横跨母体和真实两个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power of the One extends beyond this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.79,0:27:29.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的力量可穿越母体 到达他诞生的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It reaches from here all the way back to where it came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.92,0:27:31.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 诞生的地方? - 代码之源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - The source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.65,0:27:36.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你抗击那些乌贼时 你就感受到了 当时你并没有想到会有那种力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you felt when you touched those sentinels, but you weren't ready for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.91,0:27:42.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你本来应该被杀死的 但很显然你命不该绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be dead, but apparently you weren't ready for that either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.92,0:27:49.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体设计师说如果在午夜前 我还没回到代码之源...锡安就会被毁掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Architect said that if I didn't return to the source, Zion would be destroyed tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.86,0:27:54.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样说... 可能我们都参透不了自己的选择...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. You and I may not be able to see beyond our own choices...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.24,0:27:57.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但那个设计师也参透不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but that man can't see past any choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:28:01.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么不能? - 他对那些选择一无所知 当然无法参透{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? - He doesn't understand them. He can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.48,0:28:04.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对他来说 那些选择就象是方程式里的变数{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To him, they are variables in an equation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.37,0:28:08.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须将它们一一解开 再对立平衡 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One at a time, each variable must be solved, then countered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.13,0:28:12.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他的目的 令方程式平衡起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his purpose. To balance the equation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.55,0:28:14.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你的目的呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.75,0:28:16.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,令方程式不平衡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To unbalance it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:19.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么? 你这样做的目的是什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.78,0:28:23.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目的跟你一样 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the same thing you want, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:26.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了达成目的我将和你并肩作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm willing to go as far as you are to get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.73,0:28:29.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结束母体和真实世界之战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end of the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.93,0:28:32.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这场战争会结束吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it going to end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.06,0:28:34.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总会结束的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One way or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.78,0:28:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能够保住锡安吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can Zion be saved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.57,0:28:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 这个问题我也说不准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I don't have the answer to that question, but....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.32,0:28:49.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果要找答案的话...只有一个地方可以找到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is an answer, there's only one place you're going to find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.34,0:28:52.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么地方? - 你知道在什么地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - You know where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.73,0:28:57.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过如果你找不到答案...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you can't find the answer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.26,0:29:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那全人类都将失去明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then I'm afraid there may be no tomorrow for any of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.47,0:29:05.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.00,0:29:12.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,万物只要有开始...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything that has a beginning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.76,0:29:15.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...就必有结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.55,0:29:18.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到末日来临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see the end coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:21.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世界一片黑暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see the darkness spreading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.73,0:29:23.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,万物被灭绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.88,0:29:27.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你就是能阻挡他的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are all that stands in his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.25,0:29:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,史密斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.99,0:29:34.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用多久 "他"就会拥有摧毁这个世界的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very soon, he is going to have the power to destroy this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.21,0:29:37.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"他"不止会摧毁人类世界...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I believe he won't stop there. He can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...还会摧毁所有的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't stop until there's nothing left at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.63,0:29:42.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个"他"是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.39,0:29:46.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"他"就是你 你自己的对立面、负面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is you. Your opposite, your negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.87,0:29:50.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是方程式为求平衡的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The result of the equation trying to balance itself out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.73,0:29:54.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 万一我不能阻止他呢? - 尼欧 无论怎样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And if I can't stop him? - One way or another, Neo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.25,0:29:58.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...这场战争会结束的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this war is going to end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:06.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚 母体和真实世界的命运 就取决于你们谁胜谁负了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, the future of both worlds will be in your hands... ...or in his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.34,0:30:25.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉怎么样? 还好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you feeling? Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.67,0:30:34.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:42.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以理解 - 罗伦舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That figures. - Captain Roland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.46,0:30:45.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么事? 美琪 - 班尼他醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's up, Maggie? - Bane is. He's conscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.75,0:30:48.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 他可能会帮我们解开一些谜团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Maybe he's got some answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.47,0:30:57.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,味道真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love that smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.57,0:31:01.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种味道我无法忘记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure am going to miss it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.20,0:31:06.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先知 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oracle. - I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.00,0:31:09.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莎蒂 小宝贝...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sati, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.29,0:31:16.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拿些饼干 和守护天使走吧 - 我可以回来吗? 我很想回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take a few cookies and go with Seraph. - Can I come back? I would like to come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.34,0:31:19.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然可以回来 - 那我们明天见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would like that too. - Then I'll see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.20,0:31:25.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望明天仍能相见吧 小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope so, hon, I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.71,0:31:49.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,守护天使 我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm scared, Seraph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.34,0:31:52.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.23,0:32:38.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他正跟随着我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's following us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.31,0:32:46.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 好久不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, it's been a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.23,0:32:53.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 印象中 你行动迅速 很难追踪 - 我打败过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I remember chasing you was like chasing a ghost. - I have beaten you before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.39,0:32:59.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 不过你也明白 现在的情况已有所不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, true, but as you can see, things are a little different now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.82,0:33:03.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定是最后一个流亡者 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you must be the last exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.53,0:33:07.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先知跟我说过你 - 真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Oracle told me about you. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.07,0:33:11.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她说我怎样? - 她说你是个坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did she say about me? - That you were a bad man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.54,0:33:17.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 其实我也不是那么坏 只是你不了解我而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm not so bad, once you get to know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.51,0:33:49.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,聪明绝顶、料事如神的先知 我们终于见面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great and powerful Oracle, we meet at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.12,0:33:56.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在等我来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose you've been expecting me, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.69,0:34:02.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有事能令洞悉一切的先知大惊小怪 因为她无所不知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The all- knowing Oracle is never surprised. How can she be? She knows everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.16,0:34:07.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是如果她无所不知 那她为何还留在这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if that's true, then why is she here if she knew I was coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.65,0:34:10.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那她为何不离开?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wouldn't she leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.82,0:34:17.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能你早知道我会这样做 但也可能不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you knew I would do that, maybe you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.89,0:34:21.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你早知道的话 那表示你是故意烤那些饼干...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you did, that means you baked those cookies and set that plate there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.53,0:34:23.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...再放在那个盘里来让我摔碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...deliberately, purposefully...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.78,0:34:27.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你现在也是故意坐在这里 等我把你干掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which means that you're sitting there also deliberately, purposefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.38,0:34:30.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对莎蒂做了些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do with Sati?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.94,0:34:36.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,饼干跟其他东西一样 需要爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Cookies need love like everything does."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.05,0:34:39.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.93,0:34:43.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就让妈妈你见识一下我这混蛋吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would know, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.83,0:34:48.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管动手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what you're here to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.64,0:34:51.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.46,0:35:40.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很想解开大家的疑惑 只是... 我什么也不记得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really wish I could help, but I just.... I don't remember any of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.32,0:35:46.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你手臂上的那些伤痕 是怎么回事? 以前就见到过那些伤痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the cuts on your arms? Those cuts are more than one day old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.27,0:35:48.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 的确如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.95,0:35:51.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 你说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right about that, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.87,0:35:55.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些伤痕象是自己弄伤的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look like they might be self- inflicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.48,0:35:59.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我为什么要伤害自己呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why would I do something like that to myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.01,0:36:04.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我被别人附体了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless, of course, I wasn't myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.17,0:36:09.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我被别人附体 那个人又是谁呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I'm not me, then who am l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.18,0:36:18.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为他做过精神状态检查吗? - 做过了 没有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Has this man been tested for VDTs? - Yes, sir. It was negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.03,0:36:22.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他的脑电波活动很不正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he is showing a lot of unusual neural activity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.04,0:36:26.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脑兴奋细胞交叉相连 最近还发现有创伤痕迹...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some cross- synaptic firing, as well as signs of recent trauma...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.60,0:36:29.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及整个脑皮层的纤维磨损{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with fresh fibrotic scarring throughout the cortex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.04,0:36:35.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道真相 无论如何都要让他恢复记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the truth. I don't care what it takes. Make him remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.34,0:36:58.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 找到了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.17,0:37:02.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 找到罗格斯号? - 是的 舰长 - 是该有些好消息了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Logos? - Yes, sir. - About time we had some goddamn good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.44,0:37:34.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,热量探测器有没有检测到生命迹象?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are the thermals picking up any signs of life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.00,0:37:37.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 舰长. 什么也没发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. Nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.44,0:37:41.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们的战舰怎么样? - 全像探测仪显示舰身完好无损{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about the ship? - Holographic says the hull's still intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.08,0:37:44.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就在这降落吧 派一个人留守舰尾炮塔 - 好的 舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drop down and keep a man in the turret. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.42,0:37:58.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽快全面地检查那艘战舰是否损坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a full diagnostic on that ship as fast as humanly possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.14,0:38:18.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 要保持警惕 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.24,0:38:22.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些混蛋乌贼常常神出鬼没的 这里面可能有陷阱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The squids are sneaky bastards. It could be a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.46,0:38:49.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么声音?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.90,0:38:55.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大伙不用检查了 这艘战舰只是没有能源而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can put that shit away, boys. All she needs is a jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.47,0:38:59.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 奈奥比 - 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Niobe. - Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.43,0:39:05.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吧? - 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - Yes, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.00,0:39:09.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从...我们就豪无头绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't know what happened after....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.72,0:39:13.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起 - 没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.87,0:39:16.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很高兴能重逢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm happy to see you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.75,0:39:19.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们救出尼欧了吗? - 救出了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get Neo out? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.08,0:39:21.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是怎么知道的? - 先知说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you know about that? - The Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:25.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你见过她? - 就在那些乌贼发现我们之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saw her? - Just before the sentinels found us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.05,0:39:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她跟你说了什么? - 都是那些她经常挂在嘴边的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did she tell you? - The same thing she always does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.69,0:39:33.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但那些话却是我必须知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly what I needed to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.64,0:39:37.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最多十二个小时 乌贼军团就会突破城墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 12 hours, the machines will breach the dock walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.31,0:39:42.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从做过的各种模拟测试来看 一旦乌贼军团攻进城内...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every simulation we've run, we've seen that once the machines are inside the city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:44.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我们生存的机会就很渺茫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the odds of our survival decrease dramatically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.82,0:39:47.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此我们的首要任务就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus, our primary objective must be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.23,0:39:50.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...一有钻头钻进外墙 马上将它摧毁或者废掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to destroy or disable the diggers inside the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.76,0:39:54.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样做也许就能永远将它们挡在城墙之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can do that, perhaps we can prevent them from ever reaching the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.02,0:39:57.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它们攻了进来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If not, the only place we will be able to mount a defense...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.90,0:40:00.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能够作坚固防御的地方就只有神殿入口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will be at the entrance of the temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.75,0:40:03.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由于入口狭窄 那些乌贼无法进来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is small and will force them into a bottleneck...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.49,0:40:06.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们就能将剩余的防守力量 集中起来 共同迎敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...allowing us to concentrate the remainder of our defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.93,0:40:10.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听说你要征召更多的志愿兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We understand that you've requested additional volunteers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.16,0:40:11.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.15,0:40:15.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算派多少兵力驻守战舰港口这个重要据点? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely what size force are you planning to commit to the primary dock objective?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.07,0:40:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,精确数量 目前我打算用整个装甲部队和半个步兵团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, the entire APU Corps and half the infantry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.97,0:40:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 半个步兵团? - 议员 如果由我作主的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Half the infantry? - lf it were up to me, councillor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.31,0:40:26.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会号召所有的男人 女人和小孩...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'd take every man, woman and child, put a gun in their hand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.41,0:40:29.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们武装起来 一起在战舰港口迎击敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and march them into that dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:31.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来不能由你作主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps it is best that it is not up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.76,0:40:33.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事态的发展将证明我是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time will tell, councillor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.00,0:40:36.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥官 最后一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, just one more question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.38,0:40:39.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼布加尼撒号有过消息吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has there been word from the Nebuchadnezzar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:42.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 目前也不能期待它会有任何消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None, and at this point there's no reason to expect there will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.90,0:40:44.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能你说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.20,0:40:46.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们仍然希望会有消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.35,0:40:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来不依靠希望这个东西 只从实际出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid hope is an indulgence I don't have time for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.68,0:41:05.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 姬儿 你在干什么? - 做炮弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zee, what are you doing? - Making shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.17,0:41:08.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在疏散我们这一层 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're evacuating our level. We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.04,0:41:10.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不跟你走 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not going with you. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:14.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们征召志愿者留守战舰港口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've called for volunteers to hold the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.20,0:41:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个 呆在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, you stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:24.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,姬儿 我知道你怎么想 但你不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you feel, but you can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.44,0:41:26.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我必须这样做 - 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have to. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.57,0:41:28.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我爱他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.26,0:41:31.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱他 他也同样爱着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love him the same as he loves me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.58,0:41:35.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我跟他处境互调 他也会这样做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I were out there and he were here, I know what he'd do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.83,0:41:40.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你这是去送死 姬儿 你这样做并不理智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're gonna get yourself killed. It's crazy, Zee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.70,0:41:45.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是吧 但你扪心自问 如果换了是道瑟...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it is. But ask yourself, if it were Dozer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.39,0:41:49.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...而你跟他重逢的唯一机会是 参军驻守战舰港口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you knew the only chance you had to see him was to hold the dock...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.30,0:41:51.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what would you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.26,0:41:58.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做炮弹吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make shells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.12,0:42:12.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the shit is going on over here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.26,0:42:15.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个小意外 长官 刚才没看路 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An accident, sir. I didn't see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.01,0:42:18.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真不好意思 - 你是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. - Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.25,0:42:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是志愿军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A unit volunteer, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:25.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,象你这种瘦弱的人 也想到我的部队当志愿兵?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a pod- born pencil- neck like you doing volunteering for my Corps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.72,0:42:30.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想出一份力 长官 我们得保卫战舰港口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to do my part, sir. We gotta hold the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.26,0:42:36.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这小子多大了? - 十八岁 你应说十六岁 我才会相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How old are you, kid? - Eighteen. Should have said 16, I might have believed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.27,0:42:39.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 我十六岁 - 够十八岁的人才能参加部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, I'm 16. - Minimum age for the Corps is 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.63,0:42:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十六岁不够格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixteen's too young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.41,0:42:46.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些乌贼军团可不管我多少岁 它们杀戮起来毫不留情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The machines don't care how old I am. They'll kill me just the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.81,0:42:49.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个倒也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't that the goddamn truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.10,0:42:53.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我参军吧 我不会让你失望的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a chance, sir. I won't let you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.05,0:42:59.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是让我失望 我会象乌贼一样教训你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do, and you'll find me and the machines have got something in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.41,0:43:14.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 给点火器充电吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, charge the igniter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.28,0:43:21.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战舰又可以操作了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She lives again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.81,0:43:25.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们需要跟我们联线 重装操作软件吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to reload the operations software, Sparky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.72,0:43:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 太感谢了! 顺便把舰窗也擦干净吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Could you clean the windshield while you're at it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.82,0:43:36.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已联线 我正在命令它 再次跟其他战舰联机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uplinks in place. I'm bringing her back online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.82,0:43:40.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切正常 不过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking good, except....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.34,0:43:43.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...母体传来的东西有些不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong with the Matrix feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.68,0:43:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并没有什么不妥 你看到的跟我们一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, there's not. You're looking at what we're looking at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.89,0:43:51.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这到底是怎么啦? - 是有些不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on in there? - Whatever it is, it can't be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.41,0:43:54.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼军团已占领二十一号交汇处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The machines have taken Junction 21.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.33,0:43:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到 153 号高速线寻找突破口...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I see it, if we drop down from broadcast here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.65,0:44:00.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...并且发动突袭 会让它们大吃一惊的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...intersect 153, we might surprise them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.81,0:44:04.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们先冲下去全力杀敌 再使用电磁脉冲武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go first, hammer as deep as we can, then blow our EMP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.93,0:44:09.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望能够打开一个缺口 你们就可以穿过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully we can punch a hole big enough for you to get through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.70,0:44:15.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不是妙计 但这是唯一的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't pretty, but the way I see it, it's the only way back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.65,0:44:17.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.37,0:44:20.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他的办法 看看这条援助线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another way. A support line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.55,0:44:24.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它延伸到这里 离二十一号区有一千米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It drops down right here, 1000 meters short of 21.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.26,0:44:28.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的话 我们可以悄悄飞进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're lucky, we may be able to slip down without them ever knowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.75,0:44:30.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个不可能 那是机械运输线 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a mechanical line. It's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.15,0:44:33.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 在里面无法飞行 - 我可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one can pilot a mechanical. - I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.37,0:44:35.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 胡扯 - 我曾在里面飞行过 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bullshit. - I've done it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.64,0:44:39.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 奈奥比 那是很久前的事了 - 我说到做到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was a long time ago, Niobe. - I said I can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.16,0:44:43.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样? 就算你能做到 也只是你一个人能够做到 我们可不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what? You'll be the only one that can. There's no way we can follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.21,0:44:47.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.50,0:44:54.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间不多了 本来我不该这么久才出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know time is always against us. I'm sorry that I took so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.13,0:44:57.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 只是我想弄清楚 - 弄清楚什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I wanted to be sure. - Sure of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.47,0:45:00.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道我该做些什么了 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know what I have to do. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.52,0:45:03.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很难解释 我还是直言好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no easy way to say this, so I'll just say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.77,0:45:06.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要用到一艘战舰 - 什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have to take one of the ships. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.56,0:45:08.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要去哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To go where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.38,0:45:11.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去机器城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the machine city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.95,0:45:17.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这有点令人费解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's difficult to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.67,0:45:20.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并不令人费解 只是你头脑发昏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not. You're out of your goddamn mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.96,0:45:23.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我仍然得去那里 - 你去不了的 近一百年来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I still have to go. - In 100 years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.57,0:45:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有战舰可以靠近它一百公里范围内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no ship has been within 100 kilometers of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.92,0:45:28.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你进不去的 - 我必须试一试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll never make it. - I have to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.31,0:45:31.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先知叫你这样做的吗? - 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ls this what the Oracle has told you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.96,0:45:35.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样做很莽撞 你想送死的话 那就去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is asinine. If you want to kill yourself, do it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.21,0:45:37.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过不能动用我们的战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but do it without wasting our ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.55,0:45:40.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你得相信我 我必须去 - 胡扯! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to believe me. I have to go. - Bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.18,0:45:43.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是舰长 战舰该怎么用 取决于我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the captain of this ship. I say where it has to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.74,0:45:48.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿战舰毁掉也不让你用它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this ship will go to hell long before I let you take it anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.18,0:45:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他驾驶我的战舰好了 - 你不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He can take mine. - You can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.24,0:45:59.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才的对话令人很反感...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try to tell me what I can or cannot do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.24,0:46:01.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我的战舰不用你来管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with my ship after that little speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.84,0:46:06.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可也得考虑清楚啊 - 我来驾驶这艘战舰 他可以用我的战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But for chris sake, Niobe...- I'll pilot this ship, he can take mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.44,0:46:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们在一小时内出发 就能追上乌贼军团到达锡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we leave inside the hour, we should reach Zion as the machines do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.31,0:46:13.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最好的安排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's as good a plan as any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.22,0:46:17.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是在牺牲战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a waste. A goddamn waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.44,0:46:25.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和他走不同的方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two ships, two directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.27,0:46:29.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思 这象是天意吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like providence, doesn't it, Morpheus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.71,0:46:33.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你可是从来不相信有救世主的 - 我仍然不信 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've never believed in the One. - I still don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.31,0:46:35.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为何这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.14,0:46:38.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.58,0:46:41.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.80,0:46:49.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这注射剂有什么用处? - 它能让你放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that for? - To help you relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.00,0:46:52.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有助你想起以前发生过的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make it easier for you to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.32,0:46:56.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我不想想起呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I don't want to remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.59,0:46:58.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你会不想想起?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you want that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.86,0:47:01.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我使用了电磁脉冲武器...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I blew that EMP?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.96,0:47:05.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...毁掉那些战舰...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I did destroy those ships...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.95,0:47:09.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...令其他同伴丧生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I am responsible for the deaths of all those men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.99,0:47:14.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我干了这些事 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I did that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.15,0:47:19.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我留在这里 会非常危险的 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it wouldn't be very safe for me here, would it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.80,0:47:33.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我俩中的你也会非常危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, it might not be very safe for you either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.85,0:47:43.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.08,0:47:46.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.01,0:47:49.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些话我得向你说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's something I have to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.71,0:47:55.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情你必须明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something you need to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.68,0:47:59.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm supposed to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.71,0:48:05.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除此之外...我并不知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But beyond that... ...I don't know. I....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.62,0:48:10.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 你以为你将无法回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. You don't think you're coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.38,0:48:16.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你说该走了的时候我就感受到了 你的神情也流露出这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it the moment you said you had to leave. I could see it in your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.55,0:48:22.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正如你看到我时...就知道我会和你共赴患难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like you knew the moment you looked at me that I was coming with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.73,0:48:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我感到不安 崔妮蒂 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm scared, Trin. - So am l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.55,0:48:32.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不安到要花十分钟才能系好一只皮靴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took me 10 minutes to buckle up one boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.13,0:48:35.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须告诉你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.27,0:48:38.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六小时前 我跟梅罗纹奇说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six hours ago, I told the Merovingian...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.71,0:48:42.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我愿意为你牺牲一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I was ready to give anything and everything for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.14,0:48:46.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这六小时里发生了什么变化吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what's changed in the last six hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.99,0:48:48.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.38,0:48:51.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心依然没变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.66,0:49:06.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 装好弹药了吗? - 快了 舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Finished loading ammunition? - Just about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.66,0:49:08.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动吧 时间紧迫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move it. We are out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.76,0:49:11.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不留些东西给他们吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not leaving them anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.13,0:49:13.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说不需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he didn't need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.57,0:49:21.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不说道别的话 只想祝你行动顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't saying goodbye. I'm saying good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.04,0:49:22.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.68,0:49:30.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望你能知道此次的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only hope you know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.63,0:49:32.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也在提醒自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.39,0:49:39.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能担次大任是我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an honor, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.41,0:49:45.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能委以你大任才是我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the honor is still mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.21,0:50:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一切就绪 舰长 - 出发吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're ready, sir. - About damn time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.45,0:50:06.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出发得晚了 必须以最快速度前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're already late, captain, so let's hit it and hit it hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.57,0:50:14.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 再见了 好好照顾他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, baby. Take good care of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.27,0:50:37.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.13,0:50:47.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,引擎仍在点火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engine's still firing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.16,0:50:50.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是保险丝问题 我去看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be a fuse. I'll check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.97,0:51:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我早该料到他会叫他的女人先来 - 班尼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should've known he'd send his bitch first. - Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.56,0:51:11.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有人能跟你一样 总能避过我的伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one ever got away from me as many times as you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.13,0:51:13.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每次我想应该得手...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time, I thought it was the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.22,0:51:17.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...肯定你逃不掉的时候 你总能幸免于难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time, I was sure we had you, but you'd slip through our fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.20,0:51:21.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真把我气炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really can't express just how aggravating that can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.63,0:51:25.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不明白你在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.35,0:51:30.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉你 跟杀掉他一样有快感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I might enjoy killing you as much as killing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.20,0:51:49.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 是班尼搞的鬼 他疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo, it's Bane. He's psychotic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.83,0:51:53.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是要付出代价的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna pay for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.15,0:51:57.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有二十七公里 - 舰长 情况很不妙 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twenty-seven kilometers to go. - We got an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.10,0:51:59.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么事 AK? - 美琪出事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it, AK? - It's Maggie, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.79,0:52:05.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她死了 是被杀的 班尼杀了她 - 妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's dead, murdered. I think it was Bane. - Goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.74,0:52:10.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就觉得他行为反常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it. I knew he was out of his goddamn mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.39,0:52:12.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还动用了电磁脉冲武器 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fired that EMP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.08,0:52:16.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没能揍他一顿真是便宜了这小子 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, I should have beaten it out of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.65,0:52:20.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 我们搜过了整艘战舰... 没发现他的踪影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We searched the whole ship, captain. He ain't here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.63,0:52:23.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道他现在在哪 - 在罗格斯号上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know where he is. - The Logos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.47,0:52:26.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得回去 - 来不及了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We gotta go back. - Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.66,0:52:29.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许他们需要我们的帮助 - 太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What if they need our help? - It's too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.62,0:52:32.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么? - 如果班尼杀了尼欧他们 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Because if he's killed them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.29,0:52:34.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会动用另一个电磁脉冲武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he'll control another EMP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.90,0:52:38.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今 只有靠他们自己了 跟我们一样 什么都得靠自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this point, they're on their own. Just like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.16,0:52:42.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安德森先生...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.11,0:52:47.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...无论在真实世界还是母体世界 你都不怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you are as predictable in this world as you are in the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.09,0:52:48.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 他疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - He's out of his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.92,0:52:52.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你很肤浅 安德森先生...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might appear that way. But Mr. Anderson and I know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.59,0:52:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...和我都明白外表可以伪装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that appearances can be deceiving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.32,0:52:59.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安德森先生 不清楚发生了什么事? 不用多久你就会明白 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confused, Mr. Anderson? It'll all become clear in a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.31,0:53:02.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你拿枪给我 把它放下就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for bringing me the gun. You can set it down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.65,0:53:04.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别听他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.29,0:53:09.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 开枪吧 - 对 开枪啊 把我们一块烧死! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shoot. Shoot now. - Yes, shoot. Fry us. Burn us alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.39,0:53:13.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪吧! 如果你不开枪 他会杀了我们俩个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it. If you don't, he'll kill us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.73,0:53:17.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧他 知道该开枪 却下不了手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him. He knows he should do it, but he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.88,0:53:21.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他做不到的 - 开枪吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He can't. - Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.16,0:53:32.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往后退 再转过身去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back away from the gun and turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.75,0:53:40.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.65,0:53:56.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,似曾相识 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow familiar, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.85,0:54:01.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前也曾这样过 你和我 记得吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been here before, you and l, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.12,0:54:05.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我印象深刻 脑里浮现的全是当时的情景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do. I think of nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.21,0:54:13.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? - 仍然不认得我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Still don't recognize me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.27,0:54:18.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也难怪 你藏身于这个臭皮囊中...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admit, it is difficult to even think encased in this rotting piece of meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.14,0:54:24.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...吸着臭气 活在受污染的环境中 当然脑筋转不快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stink of it filling every breath, a suffocating cloud you can't escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.57,0:54:28.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是讨厌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.61,0:54:34.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类的躯体就是这么脆弱 真可悲 这么脆弱的物种应该被灭绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at how pathetically fragile it is. Nothing this weak is meant to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.66,0:54:44.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你有什么目的? - 我的目的跟你一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want? - I want what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.28,0:54:50.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了... 这就对了 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. That's it, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.74,0:54:53.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,透过你那双无精打采的肉眼看事物时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look past the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.54,0:54:59.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...要不被事物的形体迷惑 这样才能真正认识敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look through the soft gelatin of these dull cow eyes and see your enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.97,0:55:03.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不可能的 - 你看得没错 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Oh, yes, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.68,0:55:06.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不可能的 - 我想去哪就能到哪 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt can't be. - There's nowhere I can't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.84,0:55:09.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想抓你就能抓到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nowhere I won't find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.83,0:55:14.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是不可能的 - 我无所不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's impossible. - Not impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.30,0:55:16.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是必然的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.73,0:55:19.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.83,0:55:22.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个就是了 没错的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it. It's gotta be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.17,0:56:09.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.45,0:56:30.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿你还看得见吧 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you could see yourself, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.85,0:56:37.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,盲眼救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blind messiah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.06,0:56:45.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是人类的象征 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a symbol for all of your kind, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.42,0:56:49.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孤立无助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helpless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.05,0:56:54.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,悲惨可悯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pathetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.07,0:57:01.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,期待着得到解脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just waiting to be put out of your misery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.80,0:57:09.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.15,0:57:22.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会就此了结的 安德森先生 不会就此了结的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not over, Mr. Anderson. It's not over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.32,0:57:39.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 崔妮蒂! - 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Trinity! - Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.61,0:57:42.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.62,0:57:48.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 不 你的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. Your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.21,0:57:50.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能适应的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.52,0:57:54.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, Trin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.41,0:57:58.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是以后得靠你驾驶战舰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think you're gonna have to drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.06,0:58:08.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地震仪测出乌贼军团 需要二十二分钟才能钻破城墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seismic's projecting 22 minutes to breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.40,0:58:13.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们不知道我们没有电磁脉冲武器 所以它们会分批进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't know we don't have an EMP. They'll have to attack in waves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.22,0:58:17.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们集中兵力毁掉它们的钻头 命令装甲部队进入战斗位置 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concentrate our offense on the diggers. Order the APUs into position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.13,0:58:18.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.16,0:58:51.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点搬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.44,0:59:25.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.08,0:59:27.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于到了最后的关头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.20,0:59:32.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都知道我性格直率...这一次我也是长话短说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you all know me, so I'll just say this as simple as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.12,0:59:37.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们应该阵亡 那也没有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's our time to die, it's our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.05,0:59:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我要你们做到的是 如果必须死在敌人手上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I ask is, if we have to give these bastards our lives...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.80,0:59:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...那就跟敌人同归于尽吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we give them hell before we do! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.65,1:00:06.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 查拉 你怕吗? - 那还用说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You scared, Charra? - Shit, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.55,1:00:08.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们可以合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll make you a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.83,1:00:11.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你装弹药 我射击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep loading, I keep shooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.27,1:00:15.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.41,1:00:28.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢 你们看到了吗? - 镇静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holy Christ, would you look at that. - Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.76,1:00:31.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 距离出口还有多远? - 1.4 公里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How far to the opening? - 1.4 kilometers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.73,1:00:36.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们的能源消耗太快了 - 高斯 停用所有的辅助系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're still generating too hot a field. - Ghost, kill all auxiliary systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.82,1:00:41.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 将四个推进器关掉 全部手动操作 - 这样战舰会飞不起的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me full manual. Drop down four pads. - lt'll bottom out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.38,1:00:54.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 慢慢下降吧 - 七百米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Easy, baby. - Seven hundred meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.47,1:01:00.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望能接近出口吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can just get close enough....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.61,1:01:05.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六百米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six hundred meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.40,1:01:07.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.32,1:01:16.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.82,1:01:22.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这下麻烦了 它们来了 - 开足马力 启用所有系统! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jig's up, here they come. - Give me full power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.25,1:01:24.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备开炮射击!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man the gun turrets, every goddamn one of them. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.70,1:01:29.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧! 高斯 你是神炮手 跟他们去吧 由莫费思来驾驶战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghost, you're the best gunner, go with them. Morpheus, take his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.80,1:01:48.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 我来啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.74,1:01:59.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.28,1:02:08.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 开慢点 这可不是罗格斯号! - 可别把你的午饭吐出来了 现在才开始来真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slow down, this ain't the Logos. - Hang on to your lunch, Roland, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.13,1:02:19.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 原来战舰还可以这样驾驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy Christ, I didn't know this ship could do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.08,1:03:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战舰港口的外墙被钻破了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breach! The dock is breached!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.57,1:03:35.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备迎战!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knuckle up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.79,1:03:51.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保卫锡安!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Zion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.44,1:06:00.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.00,1:06:07.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.95,1:06:14.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狠狠的打!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knuckle up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.45,1:06:31.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.61,1:06:35.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给九号装弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload nine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.09,1:06:42.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧! 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go! Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.22,1:06:56.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,提防左边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.47,1:07:00.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别让它们过去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let them through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.39,1:07:04.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朱卡!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zuka!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.19,1:07:43.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太吓人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.28,1:08:00.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,步兵哪去了? 快把乌贼干掉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell's my infantry? I want that goddamn machine taken down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.68,1:08:35.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你享用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dig this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.67,1:08:41.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.01,1:09:04.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 又来了很多乌贼 - 妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bogey two at the breach point! - Goddamn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.03,1:09:32.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战舰尾部遭到攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, she's got a fat ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.53,1:09:45.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把这些乌贼赶走 - 妈的 这么多乌贼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep them off me! - Christ, there's a shitstorm of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.53,1:10:20.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 舰长 看到了吗? - 它们想破坏无线电 必须阻止它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see that? - They're after the radio. Stop them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.31,1:10:28.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.25,1:10:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.53,1:11:08.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住我的皮带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab my belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.99,1:11:21.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要消灭你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me one clean shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.46,1:11:28.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.26,1:11:53.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.03,1:12:00.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 洛克指挥官 有物体侵入! - 很多地方都被突破了 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got incoming! - We got a dock full of incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.46,1:12:03.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但这次有所不同 - 什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. But this is different, sir. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.38,1:12:05.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是自己人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's one of ours, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.85,1:12:08.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不可能 - 全像探测仪正在确认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's impossible. - Holographics are trying to confirm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.99,1:12:13.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 跟他们联系 核对密码 - 正在尝试 但没有回应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Contact them. I want access codes. - We're trying, sir. There's no response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.65,1:12:17.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是诡计而已 不可能是自己人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trick. That's not one of ours, it can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.69,1:12:21.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是机械运输线 在里面无法飞行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a mechanical line. No one can pilot mechanical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.77,1:12:35.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 战舰前后右转三十度 下倾八十度 - 右转三十度 下倾八十度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forward aft, 30 degrees at 80 percent. - Thirty degrees, 80.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.86,1:12:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 右下舷右转六十度 - 下倾二十度 六十度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lower starboard 60 degrees, 20 percent. - Sixty degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.66,1:12:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈的! 你得一直配合我! - 我尽量做到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! Come on, keep up! - Try!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.64,1:13:09.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 全像探测仪确认无误 是沙漠号 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, holographic confirms. It's the Hammer, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.52,1:13:10.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.81,1:13:12.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它遭受重创 破烂不堪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's under attack, sustaining damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.80,1:13:16.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过以它目前的速度 它将在十二分钟后抵达三号门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At its present velocity, it'll reach Gate Three in 12 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.62,1:13:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥官 它的电磁脉冲武器 可以消灭附近所有的乌贼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their EMP could take out every sentinel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.76,1:13:23.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不止这样 还可以瓦解我们整个防御系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd take out more than that. It'll wipe out our defense system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.08,1:13:25.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们使用电磁脉冲武器 战舰港口就会沦陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We blow an EMP inside, we lose the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.97,1:13:28.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 战舰港口已经沦陷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we already lost the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.44,1:13:33.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开三号门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.16,1:13:39.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三号门没有回应 它受到严重破坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gate Three is not responding! We've taken critical damage, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.40,1:13:42.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以无法遥控 也无法打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost control! We can't open it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.24,1:13:53.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那里是出口 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.81,1:13:56.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给指示时 就以全速前进 并将右舷左下部调低九十度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my mark, give me full power 90 degrees to lower- left starboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.15,1:13:58.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全速前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full power...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.91,1:14:00.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,九十度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...ninety degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.64,1:14:08.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,照做吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.62,1:14:17.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 坚持下去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.35,1:14:24.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这女人驾驶战舰真有一手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn, woman, you can drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.51,1:14:27.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还没到家呢 大门打开了没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't home yet. What about the gate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.63,1:14:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼已入侵战舰港口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentinels are inside the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.85,1:14:33.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是来晚了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we too late?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.28,1:15:05.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有多少装甲部队在战斗? - 十三个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many APUs are operational? - Thirteen, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.55,1:15:08.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,联络最接近三号门的那部装甲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me the one closest to Gate Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.86,1:15:37.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.51,1:15:39.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,炮弹用得真快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's pissing metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.08,1:15:43.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.26,1:15:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.28,1:16:23.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 乌贼冲过来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up! They're coming around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.74,1:16:37.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你后面有乌贼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.35,1:16:54.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,炮弹箱被卡住了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's jammed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.87,1:17:01.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,算啦! 赶快离开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it, kid! Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.69,1:17:04.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,炮弹箱行了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.87,1:17:35.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦凡利上尉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Mifune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.99,1:17:40.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.49,1:17:42.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.55,1:17:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汉漠号来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming. The Hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.71,1:17:50.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.49,1:17:53.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去把三号门打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to open that gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.05,1:17:56.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要切断门链才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the counterweights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.15,1:18:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.54,1:18:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry. There's no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.02,1:18:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上尉 我还没有完成训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain... ...I didn't finish the training program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.59,1:18:13.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither did l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.37,1:18:38.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别用炮弹了 - 停止炮弹供应 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lock that down! - Kill the feeder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.15,1:18:41.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们非得使用电磁脉冲武器不可了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't make it. We gotta blow the EMP now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.58,1:18:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 里面的人快开门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, someone, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.85,1:19:01.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重心移向前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the weight forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.00,1:19:05.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,轻巧无比 轻巧无比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light as a feather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.48,1:19:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥官 全像探测仪显示 麦凡利上尉的装甲正向三号门走去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holographic reports Captain Mifune's APU is up and moving to Gate Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.32,1:19:21.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要太用力扣动扳机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't over- squeeze the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.07,1:19:34.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦凡利上尉的装甲刚到达三号门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mifune's APU just reached Gate Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.68,1:19:37.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要多久才能切断门链? - 两分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much time? - Two minutes to impact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.11,1:19:42.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 麦凡利上尉请回话? - 他的无线电坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain Mifune, do you copy? - I think his radio is down, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.04,1:19:43.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麦凡利...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mifune...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.59,1:19:45.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是洛克指挥官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this is Lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.63,1:19:48.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你听到我的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you can hear me, but if you can...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.57,1:19:51.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...汉漠号将在两分钟后到达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Hammer's two minutes away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.05,1:19:55.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上尉 你须在两分钟内...把门打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got two minutes, captain, to get that gate open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.04,1:19:58.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,林克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.35,1:20:01.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到主甲板去! 准备好电磁脉冲武器!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the main deck! Charge the EMP!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.87,1:20:39.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快切断门链{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.53,1:20:46.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 你一定能成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo. I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.65,1:20:58.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太棒了 - 我们能成功吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes! - Can we make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.05,1:21:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会白跑这么远的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't come this far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.48,1:21:15.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快到家了 快到家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost home, almost home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.86,1:21:37.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,林克 开动电磁脉冲武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn it, Link!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.53,1:22:03.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你成功了 - 不 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did it. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.57,1:22:05.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是"我们"成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.84,1:22:08.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是最棒的驾驶员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a hell of a pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.23,1:22:14.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界有些事是永恒不变的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things in this world never change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.33,1:22:16.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但有些事会改变?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But some things do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.43,1:22:21.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还好 有些事会改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luckily... ...some things do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.96,1:22:34.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,林克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Link!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.56,1:22:36.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 姬儿? - 林克 - 姬儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zee? - Link! - Zee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.88,1:22:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早知道你会回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you'd come. I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.96,1:22:49.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我答应过你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.73,1:22:59.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直戴着这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did wear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.64,1:23:04.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧? 我怎么会把它摘下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding? I'm never gonna take it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.06,1:23:15.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三位舰长使用一艘战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three captains, one ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.89,1:23:20.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,估计其他两艘战舰 已经毫无意义地灰飞烟灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll assume the other ships were lost under equally pointless circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.67,1:23:22.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you too, Jason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.35,1:23:24.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,议会正等着听你们的解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Council's waiting to hear an explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.99,1:23:29.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我无法陪同 我得去收拾这个烂摊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me for not attending, but I have to try to salvage this debacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.41,1:23:32.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没听错吧 指挥官? 要不是我们 这里已经沦陷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I miss something? I thought we saved the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.72,1:23:34.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正是你们干的好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the problem with you people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.73,1:23:37.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们做事毫无远见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't think but five minutes in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.07,1:23:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们使用电磁脉冲武器 把所有设备和装甲部队都给毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That EMP knocked out almost every piece of hardware and every APU.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.03,1:23:44.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要是乌贼军团 会趁此良机立刻倾巢前来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were the machines, I'd send every sentinel here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.49,1:23:48.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为救了这里吗? 事实却是令这里岌岌可危{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save the dock, captain? You handed it to them on a silver platter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.38,1:23:55.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加把劲 切断它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get it cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.23,1:23:58.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天桥已畅通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bridge is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.09,1:24:03.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.14,1:24:06.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快把缆线修好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that cable run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.58,1:24:11.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让系统恢复运作 - 指挥官 乌贼军团企图攻击战舰港口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want the system back online! - It's the dock. They've got incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.14,1:24:14.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,命令全体撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Order everyone to fall back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.77,1:24:17.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上封掉所有垂直通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the shaft. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.23,1:24:20.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.27,1:24:25.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太吓人了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.86,1:24:35.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 已全体撤退 - 行动吧! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All clear. - Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.56,1:24:37.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快! 快走 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go! Come on! Run! - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.80,1:24:55.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该你受苦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.74,1:24:58.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样说 你把战舰给了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you gave them your ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.81,1:25:03.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 议员 - 当时你知道他要去干什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is correct, councillor, I did. - Knowing what he planned to do with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.48,1:25:07.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知没向你提过这事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Oracle said nothing of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.45,1:25:12.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知说到了重要时刻 尼欧会需要我的帮助...而我得选择帮不帮他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me Neo would need my help, and I would choose to help him or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.40,1:25:16.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是单靠一艘战舰去挑战整个机器世界 有获胜的希望吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what hope can a single vessel have against their entire defense system?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.90,1:25:20.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有希望 简直是以卵击石 但尼欧不听我的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None. It's completely impossible. But he wouldn't listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.83,1:25:24.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至连弹药也不带 他疯掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't even take any ammunition. He was totally out of his goddamn mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.95,1:25:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 他清醒得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.50,1:25:32.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧只是执行自己的使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo is doing what he believes he must do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.56,1:25:37.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他所做的是否正确...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if what he's doing is right. I don't know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.38,1:25:39.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...是否能抵达机器城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if he'll reach the machine city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.48,1:25:43.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就算他能到那里 也不知道他能做些什么来拯救我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he does, I don't know what he can do to save us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.73,1:25:49.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我确信一点 就是如果他一息尚存...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do know that as long as there is a single breath in his body...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.62,1:25:52.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...他就会坚持到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he will not give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.69,1:25:56.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也应该坚持到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither can we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.04,1:26:04.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,温度在下降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temperature's dropping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.65,1:26:08.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.89,1:26:50.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下面就是能源供应场吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're over the fields, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.73,1:26:52.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.62,1:26:55.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感受得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.27,1:27:05.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.77,1:27:09.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到吗? 我们的路就在那边 三条管线 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's our path. Can you see it? Three lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.84,1:27:11.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是电缆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.87,1:27:14.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,沿着电缆走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.72,1:27:33.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.14,1:27:34.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.71,1:27:36.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,副官!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.80,1:27:54.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.61,1:27:56.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该如何应变 指挥官?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.40,1:28:02.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迟早...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is now a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.43,1:28:06.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...乌贼军团会钻破城墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The machines will breach the walls of this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.23,1:28:12.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,建议全体议员跟老少妇孺一起 到神殿暂避{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recommend that the Council join the other non- military personnel inside the temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.33,1:28:14.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再过多久 城墙会被钻破?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long do we have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.19,1:28:16.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最多两个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hours. Maybe less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.53,1:28:23.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的部队已在入口处做好准备 严阵以待 做最后的对决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men have fortified the entrance with enough artillery to make our last stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.82,1:28:27.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保卫锡安 我能做的就是这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond that, there isn't anything more I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.73,1:28:31.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥官 你认为我们能生还吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, do you think that we have any chance of surviving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.96,1:28:36.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是议员您 就不会向我问这个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were you, I wouldn't ask me that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.52,1:28:37.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会问他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.25,1:28:44.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么? - 因为他相信有奇迹出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - He's the one who believes in miracles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.75,1:28:52.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留意那边的山脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. Those mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.93,1:28:54.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.32,1:29:00.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看到了吗? - 看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you see what's out there? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.82,1:29:03.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说能穿越那里 我就会信心十足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you tell me we'll make it, I'll believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.52,1:29:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能穿越那里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.67,1:29:09.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须飞过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.59,1:30:25.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentinels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.67,1:30:37.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,周围都是乌贼 太多了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too many!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.35,1:30:55.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住你了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.30,1:30:58.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 尼欧 快点 我需要你的帮助! - 我打不过它们 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need help here! - I can't beat them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.87,1:31:01.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我们怎么办? - 飞上去! 飞到它们上面 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do we do? - Go up, over them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.48,1:31:04.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 往高处飞 这是唯一的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - The sky! It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.01,1:31:08.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就这么办吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then up we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.93,1:31:45.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真美啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.94,1:32:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要拉动点火器 战舰才能启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pump the igniter. The ship will start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.83,1:32:19.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再拉点火器! 慢点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again. Slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.24,1:32:24.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用力拉一下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.32,1:32:51.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.18,1:32:55.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.93,1:32:57.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂? !{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.57,1:33:01.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我在这里 - 在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm here. - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.21,1:33:02.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.52,1:33:14.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.86,1:33:17.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过我们行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said we would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.00,1:33:22.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unbelievable, Trin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.43,1:33:25.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,漫地光芒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.44,1:33:28.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就象这一切是用光堆砌出来的一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the whole thing was built of light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.60,1:33:31.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你能看到就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you could see what I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.33,1:33:35.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你带我看过很多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've already shown me so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.11,1:33:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 崔妮蒂? 怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Trinity? What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.71,1:33:44.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能陪你前往了 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go with you, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.84,1:33:48.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能陪你到这了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gone as far as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.24,1:33:49.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.05,1:33:53.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.65,1:33:56.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不、不、不...!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.10,1:33:58.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.24,1:34:01.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.33,1:34:05.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已竭尽所能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done all that I could do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.08,1:34:09.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要看你自己了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you have to do the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.27,1:34:12.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须完成使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.48,1:34:15.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须拯救锡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to save Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.31,1:34:17.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.45,1:34:20.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有了你 我办不到 - 不 你办得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not without you. - Yes, you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.25,1:34:23.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能拯救锡安的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.85,1:34:27.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直深信不疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe it. I always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.73,1:34:31.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.21,1:34:37.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂 你不会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity, you can't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.12,1:34:41.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.45,1:34:43.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.02,1:34:45.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我总有离开的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.56,1:34:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你救过我一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought me back once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.17,1:34:55.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但这次我真的要去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.14,1:35:03.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.31,1:35:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你在屋顶接住我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on that roof, after you caught me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.21,1:35:12.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我对你说的最后一句话吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the last thing I said to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.97,1:35:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候你说："对不起"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said, "I'm sorry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.73,1:35:19.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是没那样说就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I hadn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.87,1:35:25.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那个时候、死亡逼近的时候 我最后想的其实是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my last thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.61,1:35:29.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...多给我一个机会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wished I had one more chance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.24,1:35:33.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...去诉说心里最想说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to say what really mattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.17,1:35:38.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向你倾诉我是多么爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To say how much I loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.26,1:35:44.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多么珍惜与你在一起的每一秒时光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How grateful I was for every moment I was with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.94,1:35:51.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是到了我知道 该怎样表达心里话的时候...却已经来不及了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But by the time I knew how to say what I wanted to, it was too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.59,1:36:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你把我救了回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you brought me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.04,1:36:05.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我愿望成真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me my wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.53,1:36:13.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能够有一个机会向你诉说心里话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more chance to say what I really wanted to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.21,1:36:19.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吻吻我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.12,1:36:24.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再吻我一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once more...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.58,1:36:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吻我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...kiss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.08,1:36:58.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装填好弹药! 再不装就没机会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that ammunition where it belongs! You got one chance to get this right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.77,1:37:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪炮架好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that damn thing mounted!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.76,1:37:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快准备好 - 大伙做好准备!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry. - Let's go, let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.95,1:37:24.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:27.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要做点什么 最好快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you're gonna do something, do it quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.20,1:39:38.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只请求让我说 我该说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only ask to say what I've come to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.55,1:39:42.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说完之后 什么都行 我不会阻拦你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, do what you want, and I won't try and stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.14,1:39:48.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.64,1:39:51.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"史密斯"这个程序已经失去控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The program Smith has grown beyond your control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.41,1:39:55.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用多久 他就能象包围母体一样 包围这个城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will spread through this city as he spread through the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.28,1:39:57.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们无法阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.75,1:40:02.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 只有我才可以 - 我们不需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I can. - We don't need you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.24,1:40:05.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有能力解决任何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.45,1:40:10.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此 那我弄错了 马上把我杀掉吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's true, then I've made a mistake, and you should kill me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.48,1:40:16.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.86,1:40:19.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.80,1:40:46.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.34,1:40:54.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是怎么了? !{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.07,1:40:59.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.79,1:41:26.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你失败呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you fail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.06,1:41:30.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.06,1:41:53.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.26,1:41:55.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他为我们而战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fights for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.45,1:42:39.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安德森先生 欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Anderson, welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.75,1:42:42.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想念你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.02,1:42:49.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将这个地方弄成这样 喜欢吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like what I've done with the place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.51,1:42:51.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚将分出胜负{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ends tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.13,1:42:55.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道 我预见过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it does. I've seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.24,1:42:59.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我其他的变体都只会袖手旁观{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why the rest of me is just going to enjoy the show...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.45,1:43:03.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你将败在我手下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because we already know that I'm the one that beats you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.09,1:44:58.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到了吗 安德森先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel it, Mr. Anderson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.23,1:45:00.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死神正向你逼近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...closing in on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.86,1:45:03.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就感觉得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.34,1:45:08.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的该感谢你 终究是你的生命...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really should thank you for it. After all, it was your life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.62,1:45:12.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...让我明白了所有生命的意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that taught me the purpose of all life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.81,1:45:16.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,生命的意义就是结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The purpose of life is to end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.97,1:48:54.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 安德森先生? 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Mr. Anderson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.88,1:48:58.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, why, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.03,1:48:59.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.14,1:49:02.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么? 为何要爬起来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Why get up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.36,1:49:04.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何永不放弃?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why keep fighting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.85,1:49:10.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信自己的战斗有价值么? 甚至比你自身的生存更重要?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe you're fighting for something? For more than your survival?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.32,1:49:15.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你为何而战? 你可曾想过吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me what it is? Do you even know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.90,1:49:19.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是为了自由还是真理?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it freedom or truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.88,1:49:22.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了和平还是为爱情?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps peace? Could it be for love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.60,1:49:26.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通通都是虚幻错误的观念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Illusions, Mr. Anderson. Vagaries of perception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.17,1:49:29.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是人类智力低下的表现 拚命以此来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temporary constructs of a feeble human intellect...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.96,1:49:34.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...掩饰人类的存在并非毫无意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...trying desperately to justify an existence that is without meaning or purpose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.70,1:49:38.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但全都象母体本身那样不真实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all of them as artificial as the Matrix itself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.20,1:49:44.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只有人类才会 困惑于若有若无的感情因素{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...although only a human mind could invent something as insipid as love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.79,1:49:51.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你应该能清楚地认识到眼前的一切 到了这个时候 你必须清醒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be able to see it, Mr. Anderson. You must know it by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.07,1:49:53.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢不了的 再打下去只是白白送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't win. It's pointless to keep fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.55,1:50:00.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么? 安德森先生 为什么? 为何你这么执着?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Mr. Anderson, why? Why do you persist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.82,1:50:05.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是我的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I choose to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.21,1:51:13.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的世界! 在这里我唯我独尊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my world! My world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.64,1:51:39.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.59,1:51:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我预见过这个情景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.88,1:51:45.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 预见的结局就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it. This is the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.07,1:51:51.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 你就是那样躺在那里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. You were laying right there, just like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.23,1:51:53.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.73,1:51:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就站在这里 应该说了些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stand here, right here, and I'm supposed to say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.50,1:52:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.57,1:52:05.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,万物只要有开始 就必有结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Everything that has a beginning has an end, Neo."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.68,1:52:17.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 我刚才说了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What did I just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.86,1:52:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 不是这样的 不应该这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. This isn't right. This can't be right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.87,1:52:35.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.86,1:52:37.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在惧怕什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you afraid of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.92,1:52:39.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是圈套!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.14,1:52:42.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对 史密斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right, Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.31,1:52:46.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你总是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were always right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.40,1:52:50.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切无可避免{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.59,1:53:24.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战斗结束了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.54,1:53:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.53,1:53:59.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这并不合理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.47,1:54:55.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任务完成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.25,1:55:29.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,令人摸不着头脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.36,1:55:35.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他完成使命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.01,1:55:38.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他救了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.44,1:55:40.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他救了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.34,1:55:44.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他成功了! 他成功了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over! He did it! He did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.53,1:55:45.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他成功了! 战争结束了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did it! It's over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.82,1:55:48.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争结束了! 他成功了! 他成功了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over! He did it! He did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.33,1:55:52.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么成功了? 发生什么了? - 先生... 他成功了! 尼欧成功了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? What happened? - Sir, he did it, sir. Neo, he did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.47,1:55:54.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么成功了? - 他终止了结争!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did what? - He ended the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.74,1:55:56.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼军团走了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The machines, they're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.39,1:55:59.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war is over, sir. The war is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.15,1:56:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,锡安的人们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zion! Zion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.08,1:56:06.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,锡安的人们! 战争结束了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zion, it's over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.68,1:56:08.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争结束了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.47,1:56:11.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争结束了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war is over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.34,1:56:14.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争结束了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war is over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.59,1:56:38.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在期盼着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have imagined this moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.95,1:56:41.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...这个时刻的到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.52,1:56:47.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在做梦吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.69,1:56:58.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 无论你身在何方...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo, wherever you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.57,1:57:01.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我都感谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.64,1:57:47.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.07,1:58:12.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哟...真是巧遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now. Ain't this a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.33,1:58:14.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前的计划风险很大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You played a very dangerous game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.78,1:58:16.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想改变总得冒风险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change always is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.99,1:58:21.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的和平可以维持多久?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just how long do you think this peace is going to last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.88,1:58:25.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿能长久吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as it can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.71,1:58:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样处理其他人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.29,1:58:32.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其他什么人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.79,1:58:35.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些想要脱离母体的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones that want out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.35,1:58:38.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用说 我会释放他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously, they will be freed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.25,1:58:40.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你能否兑现承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have your word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.43,1:58:43.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我当成什么人了? 不守信的凡人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think I am? Human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.57,1:58:59.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oracle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.05,1:59:11.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们还怕会找不到你 - 一切都安然无恙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were afraid we might not find you. - Everything's okay now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.60,1:59:16.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看! 看! - 看那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, look. - Just look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.98,1:59:19.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美极了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.31,1:59:25.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你做的吗? - 献给尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you do that? - For Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.84,1:59:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很不错啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.00,1:59:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he'd love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.32,1:59:32.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会再见到他吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will we ever see him again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.99,1:59:35.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suspect so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.85,1:59:38.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会有那么一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.40,1:59:44.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经知道能再见到尼欧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you always know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.44,1:59:47.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我并不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. No, I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.20,1:59:50.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我相信...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I believed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.60,1:59:54.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信能跟他重逢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believed{\r}
